==Battleground==
*1 [[4D Cyclops (Enemy)|4D Cyclops]] spawns as the boss after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~80 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~80 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

